      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mulhall%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Zack Mulhall, the town's namesake, was a Wild West show proprietor who helped discover early movie cowboy Tom Mix.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
