        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=MU005"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early Mulhall supported a diverse economy with businesses including a broom factory, cotton gins, and a roller mill by the early 1900s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
